          "note": "Spielberg's next, a Western adapted by Paul Thomas Anderson from the Kevin Barry novel. Cillian Murphy, Jessie Buckley, Mark Rylance; doomed lovers in 1890s Montana and Idaho. News broke the morning of taping."
